{"route":"/news-highlights/1112-pt-round-02,-2023-in-biological-discipline","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"PT round-02, 2023 in biological discipline"}],"updated":"2023-05-02","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1112-pt-round-02,-2023-in-biological-discipline.html","title":"PT round-02, 2023 in biological discipline","bodyHtml":"<p>IPC is going to conduct PT round-02,2023 in biological discipline for the parameter Qualitative test for specific pathogens (Presence or Absence of Salmonella &amp; Shigella in 10 g and Escherichia coli &amp; Staphylococcus aureus in 1 g). You are requested to find the attached registration form and send your consent with filled registration form on e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in\">qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in</a> on or before 31st May 2023.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation_Letter_PT-02_2023.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><strong><a href=\"/news-highlights/1035-application-are-invited-for-the-23rd-skill-development-programme-on-pharmacovigilance-for-medical-products\" data-internal></a> <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation_Letter_PT-02_2023.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Intimation Letter PT-02, 2023<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration_Form_for_PT-022023.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><strong><a href=\"/news-highlights/1035-application-are-invited-for-the-23rd-skill-development-programme-on-pharmacovigilance-for-medical-prod